  "DoctorsNote": {
    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Celebrate the season with recipes from </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-die-cookbook/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The How Not to Die Cookbook</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\"> and </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet-cookbook/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">The How Not to Diet Cookbook</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">. </span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Get the full recipes and instructions below:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/vegetable-stacks-with-tomato-red-pepper-coulis/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Vegetable Stacks with Tomato–Red Pepper Coulis</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/gemelli-with-zucchini-meatballs-and-avocado-chimichurri/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Gemelli with Zucchini Meatballs and Avocado Chimichurri</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipe/fudgy-no-bake-brownies/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Fudgy No-Bake Brownies</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">For more free recipes, visit our</span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/recipes/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400\">recipes page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">.</span></p>\n     <p>If you haven&#39;t yet, you can <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\" title=\"Subscribe\">subscribe to our free newsletter</a>. With your subscription, you&#39;ll also get notifications for just-released blogs and videos. Check out our <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/translations-info/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Translated Resources\">information page</a> about our translated resources.</p>"
